---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact — Motiva Hub" description="Get in touch with Youssef Raihane and the Motiva Hub team." image="/images/youssef-raihane.jpg" lang="en">
  <article class="article-body container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="card-meta">CONTACT</p>
        <h1>Get in Touch</h1>
        <p class="card-date">We would love to hear from you</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>For collaborations, speaking, or general inquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@the-motivahub.com">contact@the-motivahub.com</a></p>

      <h2>What to Expect</h2>
      <p>We read every message. Response time is usually 24-48 hours. For urgent matters, please mention "URGENT" in the subject line.</p>

      <h2>Collaborations</h2>
      <p>We are open to collaborations that align with our mission: mindset, habits, discipline, and the long game. If you have a project, a product, or an idea, we would love to hear about it.</p>

      <h2>Speaking</h2>
      <p>Youssef Raihane is available for speaking engagements on topics including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Habit formation and identity-based change</li>
        <li>Discipline as a system, not a trait</li>
        <li>The 2-minute rule and the 2-day rule</li>
        <li>Attention management in the digital age</li>
        <li>Self-sabotage and the psychology of failure</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Press</h2>
      <p>For press inquiries, please use the email above with "PRESS" in the subject line. We can provide high-resolution photos, bio, and interview availability.</p>

      <h2>Follow</h2>
      <p>Stay connected:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/motivahub/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://twitter.com/motivahub" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter/X</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/motivahub" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-strip">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tools/discipline-quiz/">Take the Discipline Quiz</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/guides/atomic-habits-ultimate-guide/">Read the Ultimate Guide</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/journal/">Browse the Journal</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
